ls II is set in Drangleic, a ruined kingdom worn down by an undead curse that slowly erodes memory and identity. The player takes the role of the Bearer of the Curse, an undead traveler who comes to the kingdom searching for a way to be cured. In the quiet settlement of Majula, a figure called the Emerald Herald points the Bearer toward gathering powerful souls and seeking out King Vendrick, the land's former ruler. The journey leads across crumbling castles, forgotten crypts, and hostile wilds, where much of the kingdom's history is pieced together indirectly through the people, places, and relics the Bearer encounters. Standing between the traveler and the throne at the kingdom's heart are formidable enemies and the lingering consequences of Drangleic's fall.", "summary": "Dark Souls II: Scholar of the First Sin is an enhanced edition of Dark Souls II, released in April 2015 by FromSoftware and Bandai Namco Entertainment. This version includes updated graphics, improved performance, and all previously released DLC expansions (Crown of the Sunken King, Crown of the Old Iron King, and Crown of the Ivory King). It also features rebalanced gameplay, new enemy placements, additional NPCs, and expanded lore,", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/dark-souls-ii-scholar-of-the-first-sin", "videos": [{"id": 3210, "name": "Annoucement Trailer", "video_id": "3nErjDw8dP8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3nErjDw8dP8", "title": "Dark Souls II: Scholar of the First Sin - Annoucement Trailer (Official)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3nErjDw8dP8/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 3475, "name": "Forlorn Hope Trailer", "video_id": "nFATZnAq6Ps", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nFATZnAq6Ps", "title": "Dark Souls II: Scholar of the First Sin - Forlorn Hope Trailer (Official)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/nFATZnAq6Ps/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 543, "name": "Dark Souls"}], "characters": [{"id": 16003, "name": "Alsanna"}, {"id": 16004, "name": "King Vendrick"}, {"id": 16002, "name": "Lord Aldia"}]}